  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_marks": {
        "diana_skill2": "[Add-on] <#a974ffff>Lunar Rush<>: dash to the target for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; if the target bears <#a974ffff>Moonlight<> she dashes again at once (champions first). <#a974ffff>Pale Cascade<> (every <#ffb900ff>10s<>): on arrival a <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and three orbs that hit nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% AP<> each; after the third the shield comes again."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_marks": {
        "diana_skill2": "[확장] 대상에게 돌진해 <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 70%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. 대상에게 <#a974ffff>달빛<>이 있으면 즉시 한 번 더 돌진(챔피언 우선). <#a974ffff>은빛 가호<>(<#ffb900ff>10초<>마다): <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#e8d44dff>보호막<>, 구체 3개가 주변 적에게 각각 <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>; 3개 모두 터지면 보호막 한 번 더."
      }
